1
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:38,060
He probably won't be coming back.

2
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:43,540
Who am I?

3
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:46,240
You're nothing but my dog.

4
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:54,430
But next time, I will kill you.

5
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:57,720
This chocolate is hard to come by.

6
00:00:57,720 --> 00:00:59,580
I wouldn't give it to just anyone.

7
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:12,800
Yeah.

8
00:01:13,590 --> 00:01:15,310
He hated me anyway.

9
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:26,400
Come up. Hurry.

10
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:27,640
I promised you.

11
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:28,640
I'm back.

12
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:30,660
Shen Tianbai.

13
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:31,800
Come up!

14
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:33,400
Come up!

15
00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:43,710
[Eclipse in the Lost City]
[Episode 12]

16
00:01:44,630 --> 00:01:48,520
[A few days later]

17
00:01:47,660 --> 00:01:48,320
Don't move.

18
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:50,250
Ow, ow, ow, it hurts so much.

19
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:51,720
-Uncle Zhong.
-All done.

20
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:54,039
Young Master.

21
00:01:54,039 --> 00:01:55,289
Look at you.

22
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:57,720
Anyone who knew you went
to Jiangcheng knew where you'd been.

23
00:01:57,720 --> 00:02:00,910
Anyone who didn't know would think
you'd gone to the underworld.

24
00:02:00,910 --> 00:02:02,000
What happened to you?

25
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:04,730
You went out once
and came back looking like this.

26
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:08,080
You are the only hope
of our Qingtian Gang.

27
00:02:08,300 --> 00:02:10,020
The old chief made it

28
00:02:10,039 --> 00:02:11,780
very clear when he was alive.

29
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,960
Uncle Zhong, I was wrong.

30
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:14,800
I was wrong.

31
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:16,160
Okay.

32
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:18,570
It's good that you know you were wrong.

33
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,160
But

34
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:26,300
are the matters in Jiangcheng
all taken care of?

35
00:02:26,360 --> 00:02:28,000
Young Master, rest assured.

36
00:02:28,079 --> 00:02:30,740
The fact that you saved him
hasn't leaked out at all.

37
00:02:30,740 --> 00:02:32,760
Our people went to Jiangcheng by water.

38
00:02:32,760 --> 00:02:34,360
The Shisha Gang won't find out.

39
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,440
However,

40
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:37,920
he failed to complete the mission.

41
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:40,400
How would he explain it to Xu Qingdao?

42
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:41,980
How else can he explain it?

43
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:44,770
Take the beating and take his punishment.

44
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:47,360
It's good enough for him
to come back alive.

45
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,520
Tianbai.

46
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:50,800
What are you doing?

47
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:53,220
I failed to complete the mission.

48
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:54,320
Please punish me.

49
00:02:54,880 --> 00:02:55,760
Get up.

50
00:02:56,079 --> 00:02:56,690
Sit down.

51
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,080
Alright.

52
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:04,600
I know everything about
what happened in Jiangcheng.

53
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:05,120
Sit.

54
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:06,270
Yes.

55
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:11,680
Who could've seen this coming?

56
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:19,120
We can't afford to get involved
in Jiangcheng's affairs from Ningcheng.

57
00:03:19,960 --> 00:03:21,010
But

58
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:24,840
they can't touch anyone
I choose to protect.

59
00:03:27,640 --> 00:03:28,640
Thank you, Chief.

60
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:33,280
You almost lost your lives in Jiangcheng.

61
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:36,400
How did Lu Ye come back?

62
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:44,800
I don't know, either.

63
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:47,040
We got separated after the accident.

64
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:49,720
I see.

65
00:03:51,079 --> 00:03:51,770
Chief,

66
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,940
I'll find a chance to kill him.

67
00:03:55,160 --> 00:03:57,800
You can't force the right moment.

68
00:03:58,240 --> 00:04:02,400
But hearing you say that
puts my mind at ease.

69
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:30,480
I barely managed to get
through the Jiangcheng mess.

70
00:04:31,060 --> 00:04:33,190
But Xu Qingdao still isn't convinced.

71
00:04:33,900 --> 00:04:35,900
I must not let him get anything on me.

72
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:39,440
Looks like I'll have to be
more careful from now on.

73
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:42,860
Tianbai,

74
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:44,370
how are you feeling?

75
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:46,300
Much better. Thank you, Hui.

76
00:04:46,300 --> 00:04:47,360
Damn it.

77
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:49,640
We're buddies. No need to thank me.

78
00:04:51,080 --> 00:04:53,280
Remember, with me backing you,

79
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:55,040
Lu Ye is nothing.

80
00:04:56,300 --> 00:04:57,200
Get some good rest.

81
00:04:57,200 --> 00:04:58,040
I'm leaving.

82
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:11,440
Hui,

83
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:14,130
are you really going to deal with Lu Ye?

84
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:16,120
He dared to hit me

85
00:05:16,650 --> 00:05:18,510
and mess with my buddy.

86
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:21,760
Death would be letting him off easy.

87
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:26,420
Should we tell Tianbai

88
00:05:26,930 --> 00:05:28,370
and ask him to lend a hand?

89
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:31,760
I'm warning you.

90
00:05:32,010 --> 00:05:33,140
Don't talk too much.

91
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:35,480
If you disturb his recovery,

92
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:36,400
I won't spare you.

93
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:36,960
Yes.

94
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,730
When the time comes,

95
00:05:40,430 --> 00:05:43,230
I'll give Lu Ye's head directly to him.

96
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:46,240
He'll definitely like it.

97
00:05:46,909 --> 00:05:48,370
That's a smart move, Hui.

98
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:51,280
Once Lu Ye sets foot in Dashijie,

99
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:54,000
we'll use this incense to knock him out.

100
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:56,840
I heard this stuff works really well.

101
00:05:57,280 --> 00:05:58,480
Lu Ye,

102
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:01,440
didn't you want to return the favor?

103
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:04,320
I'll grant you your wish.

104
00:06:05,080 --> 00:06:07,080
But Hui,

105
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:09,920
what if Lu Ye doesn't come?

106
00:06:11,710 --> 00:06:13,550
He will definitely come.

107
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,470
[Do you want to know why Lu Wenbiao
was trafficking drugs?]

108
00:06:15,470 --> 00:06:17,220
[Tonight at 8:00 PM. Butterfly Hall,
Dashijie. Come alone.]

109
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:25,800
Zhuque's earring?

110
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:30,460
Could it be the person
who contacted Zhuque before?

111
00:06:32,159 --> 00:06:34,820
Someone in the Shisha Gang
must know something.

112
00:06:35,370 --> 00:06:38,210
Even if it's a trap, I still have to go.

113
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:51,720
Young Master, what's wrong?

114
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:52,560
Nothing.

115
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:00,280
You're

116
00:07:00,420 --> 00:07:02,350
still risking your life like this.

117
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:03,080
You brat,

118
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:04,880
remember, you are human,

119
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,160
not made of steel.

120
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,760
Understood, Master.

121
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,080
By the way,

122
00:07:09,440 --> 00:07:10,960
I've recorded all the symptoms.

123
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:12,490
This poison is very strange.

124
00:07:12,490 --> 00:07:14,220
Although it drives people crazy,

125
00:07:14,220 --> 00:07:15,980
it also has unexpected effects.

126
00:07:15,980 --> 00:07:16,820
What effects?

127
00:07:18,110 --> 00:07:19,640
The closer I get
to the poison taking effect,

128
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:21,120
the sharper my senses become.

129
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:22,520
I get stronger, too,

130
00:07:22,800 --> 00:07:25,580
and even my wounds heal faster.

131
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:28,320
But the stronger these effects become,

132
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:30,400
the less control I have over myself.

133
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,370
As expected,

134
00:07:31,710 --> 00:07:32,970
it matches the report.

135
00:07:37,530 --> 00:07:39,750
This is what you brought back before.

136
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:42,320
This came from the victims' bodies.

137
00:07:42,659 --> 00:07:43,330
Look,

138
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:44,610
they are different.

139
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:47,310
You suspect...

140
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:50,520
I suspect there's more
than one generation of this drug.

141
00:07:50,520 --> 00:07:53,120
Those people were injected
with an inferior version.

142
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:54,580
Look at their identities.

143
00:07:54,880 --> 00:07:56,130
They were either beggars,

144
00:07:56,130 --> 00:07:57,090
dockworkers,

145
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,980
or people with no legal identity.

146
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,320
Look at the next page.

147
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:05,120
And their bodies look
as if they'd been torn apart by wild dogs.

148
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:07,480
The way they were killed
was crude and brutal.

149
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,600
From what you've described,

150
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:11,680
their senses were probably heightened
all at once,

151
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:14,100
but they couldn't control it.

152
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,100
By the way, Master,

153
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:20,600
there is one thing that's very strange.

154
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:25,440
The maintenance dose
has to be injected every two weeks.

155
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:28,240
I noticed that the last dose was No. 1,

156
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:29,480
and this time it's No. 2.

157
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:31,000
No. 2 is darker.

158
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:34,000
The Shisha Gang's traitor
was injected with No. 2,

159
00:08:34,049 --> 00:08:37,409
but he died halfway through the injection.

160
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:42,919
So you suspect it's more
than just an antidote?

161
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:45,920
Okay.

162
00:08:46,680 --> 00:08:48,680
I'll take it back and run some tests.

163
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:50,580
Master,

164
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:52,530
be careful at the station, too.

165
00:08:52,900 --> 00:08:54,090
The chief is too scared to take any risks.

166
00:08:54,090 --> 00:08:56,160
Whenever there's trouble,
he just makes you take the fall.

167
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:58,230
You brat. Look at you, all grown up.

168
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:01,000
Now you know how
to worry about your master.

169
00:09:01,770 --> 00:09:02,460
By the way,

170
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:06,440
be careful in the Shisha Gang yourself.

171
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:08,160
Don't fall into a trap.

172
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:10,320
This stuff is called Night Fog.

173
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:13,460
It's a sedative incense
imported from the West.

174
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,520
Customs seized a shipment recently.

175
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:16,880
I've checked the records.

176
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:19,320
Someone in the Shisha Gang
bought a large amount of it.

177
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:20,860
They've got it hidden in Dashijie.

178
00:09:20,860 --> 00:09:21,340
Who?

179
00:09:22,160 --> 00:09:23,000
His name is...

180
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,400
Hui.

181
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:33,280
Master, I'll get going.

182
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:34,550
Tianbai.

183
00:10:32,330 --> 00:10:33,350
You, Lu.

184
00:10:33,560 --> 00:10:35,560
You're finally in my hands.

185
00:10:36,500 --> 00:10:38,120
That's for messing with my buddy.

186
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:39,980
That's for messing with my buddy.

187
00:11:30,700 --> 00:11:31,620
Damn it.

188
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:33,090
Young Master.

189
00:11:36,210 --> 00:11:37,140
Get him packed up

190
00:11:37,230 --> 00:11:38,120
and send him back.

191
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:38,600
Yes.

192
00:11:39,280 --> 00:11:41,680
Good thing you were cautious
when you came.

193
00:11:41,920 --> 00:11:42,520
What's...

194
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,580
What's wrong with you?

195
00:11:50,110 --> 00:11:51,510
Someone tried to help me.

196
00:11:58,920 --> 00:11:59,720
Young Master.

197
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,520
I found out who did it.

198
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:02,400
Who did it?

199
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:03,320
It was a kid.

200
00:12:03,630 --> 00:12:04,430
What?

201
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:06,880
The kid's always been
into this kind of thing.

202
00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:08,000
He never misses.

203
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:09,520
He was the one who shot the marble.

204
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:11,960
But someone told him to do it tonight.

205
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:13,400
Who?

206
00:12:13,400 --> 00:12:15,190
The kid didn't see his face clearly.

207
00:12:15,190 --> 00:12:17,590
He gave the kid a piece of chocolate.

208
00:12:21,920 --> 00:12:22,640
Right.

209
00:12:22,820 --> 00:12:25,620
He was also wearing a very unusual watch.

210
00:12:25,840 --> 00:12:27,370
The watch face was cracked.

211
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:32,200
Damn, it's all banged up.

212
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:36,880
Trust me, I'll be back before dawn.

213
00:12:46,560 --> 00:12:47,800
Shen Tianbai,

214
00:12:48,760 --> 00:12:49,800
could it really have been you?
